    "%lld/%lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld/%2$lld"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld/%lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub 仓库中的 Nothung 版本不会把个人数据发送给开发者，也不会出售或向第三方共享数据。它不包含账户、广告、分析、遥测或第三方 SDK。仅会在设备上保存最多 20 条由你明确操作产生的原文与清理结果。修改后的派生构建应根据实际行为提供自己的说明。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The version of Nothung in the GitHub repository does not send personal data to the developer, sell it, or share it with third parties. It includes no accounts, ads, analytics, telemetry, or third-party SDKs. It stores at most 20 original and cleaned items that result from your explicit actions, and only on the device. Modified builds should provide their own disclosure based on their actual behavior."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 仓库中的 Nothung 版本不会把个人数据发送给开发者，也不会出售或向第三方共享数据。它不包含账户、广告、分析、遥测或第三方 SDK。仅会在设备上保存最多 20 条由你明确操作产生的原文与清理结果。修改后的派生构建应根据实际行为提供自己的说明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NOTHUNG": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NOTHUNG"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NOTHUNG"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothung · 内置规则": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothung · Built-in rule"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothung · 内置规则"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothung 不在后台监控剪贴板。开启“允许完全访问”后，键盘只在屏幕上可见期间检查剪贴板变化，自动读取、清理并保存新文本；键盘收起或切换后即停止。主 App 仍只通过可见的系统“粘贴”控件读取你明确选择的内容，分享扩展只接收宿主 App 提供的内容。Nothung 会在本机保存最近 20 条原文和清理结果，供键盘再次插入；可在设置中随时全部清空。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothung does not monitor the clipboard in the background. After Full Access is enabled, the keyboard checks for clipboard changes only while it is visible, then automatically reads, cleans, and saves new text; it stops as soon as the keyboard is dismissed or switched. The main app still reads only content you explicitly select through the visible system Paste control, and the Share Extension receives only content supplied by the host app. Nothung stores the 20 most recent original and cleaned items on the device for reinsertion from the keyboard; you can clear them all in Settings at any time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothung 不在后台监控剪贴板。开启“允许完全访问”后，键盘只在屏幕上可见期间检查剪贴板变化，自动读取、清理并保存新文本；键盘收起或切换后即停止。主 App 仍只通过可见的系统“粘贴”控件读取你明确选择的内容，分享扩展只接收宿主 App 提供的内容。Nothung 会在本机保存最近 20 条原文和清理结果，供键盘再次插入；可在设置中随时全部清空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothung 会把当前完整 URL 通过 HTTPS 发送给目标网站，并逐跳访问它返回的地址。网站会看到你的 IP 地址和 URL；Nothung 不会附带 Cookie 或登录凭据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothung will send the complete current URL to the destination website over HTTPS and visit each address it returns. The website will see your IP address and URL; Nothung does not include cookies or sign-in credentials."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothung 会把当前完整 URL 通过 HTTPS 发送给目标网站，并逐跳访问它返回的地址。网站会看到你的 IP 地址和 URL；Nothung 不会附带 Cookie 或登录凭据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothung 在设备上执行参数与正则清理，不会把内容发送给开发者。主 App 和分享扩展在你明确操作时取得内容；获完全访问的 Nothung 键盘在可见期间自动捕捉新剪贴板。命中重定向规则时，完整 URL 会发送给链接目标。快捷指令保持本地处理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothung performs parameter and regular-expression cleaning on the device and does not send content to the developer. The main app and Share Extension receive content only when you explicitly act; with Full Access, the Nothung keyboard automatically captures new clipboard content while it is visible. When a redirect rule matches, the complete URL is sent to the link destination. Shortcuts processing remains local."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothung 在设备上执行参数与正则清理，不会把内容发送给开发者。主 App 和分享扩展在你明确操作时取得内容；获完全访问的 Nothung 键盘在可见期间自动捕捉新剪贴板。命中重定向规则时，完整 URL 会发送给链接目标。快捷指令保持本地处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothung 无法安全地清理这个链接，请检查地址后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothung could not clean this link safely. Check the address and try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothung 无法安全地清理这个链接，请检查地址后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
