    "参数与正则清理在本地完成。Nothung 不在后台读取剪贴板；开启完全访问后，键盘只在可见期间自动捕捉新文本，收起后立即停止。命中重定向规则时才会访问目标网站。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parameter and regular-expression cleaning is performed locally. Nothung does not read the clipboard in the background; after Full Access is enabled, the keyboard automatically captures new text only while visible and stops immediately when dismissed. Destination websites are contacted only when a redirect rule matches."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参数与正则清理在本地完成。Nothung 不在后台读取剪贴板；开启完全访问后，键盘只在可见期间自动捕捉新文本，收起后立即停止。命中重定向规则时才会访问目标网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "参数名称": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parameter Names"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参数名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "参数规则": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parameter Rules"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参数规则"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "参数规则先执行，再依列表顺序执行正则规则。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parameter rules run first, followed by regular-expression rules in list order."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参数规则先执行，再依列表顺序执行正则规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "参数规则只修改 URL 的查询部分。白名单仅保留指定参数；黑名单仅删除指定参数。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parameter rules modify only the query portion of a URL. An allowlist keeps only the specified parameters; a blocklist removes only the specified parameters."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参数规则只修改 URL 的查询部分。白名单仅保留指定参数；黑名单仅删除指定参数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "参数过滤和正则替换完全在本地进行。命中你启用的重定向规则时，主 App、分享扩展，以及键盘可见期间的自动捕捉流程会通过 HTTPS 访问当前 URL 和最多五个重定向目标；其他链接仅在主 App 逐次确认后展开。因此相关网站会收到你的 IP 地址、完整 URL 和常规网络元数据。解析使用临时会话，不附带 Cookie、Authorization 或登录凭据，收到响应头后立即停止读取响应体。Nothung 不会自动打开最终链接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parameter filtering and regular-expression replacement run entirely on the device. When an enabled redirect rule matches, the main app, Share Extension, and automatic capture while the keyboard is visible access the current URL and up to five redirect destinations over HTTPS; other links are expanded only after confirmation in the main app. Those websites therefore receive your IP address, complete URL, and ordinary network metadata. Resolution uses an ephemeral session, sends no cookies, Authorization header, or sign-in credentials, and stops reading the response body as soon as the headers arrive. Nothung never opens the final link automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参数过滤和正则替换完全在本地进行。命中你启用的重定向规则时，主 App、分享扩展，以及键盘可见期间的自动捕捉流程会通过 HTTPS 访问当前 URL 和最多五个重定向目标；其他链接仅在主 App 逐次确认后展开。因此相关网站会收到你的 IP 地址、完整 URL 和常规网络元数据。解析使用临时会话，不附带 Cookie、Authorization 或登录凭据，收到响应头后立即停止读取响应体。Nothung 不会自动打开最终链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
