    "完全访问后，Nothung 只在键盘可见期间检查并自动清理新的剪贴板；收起或切换键盘后立即停止。查看和插入已有记录不依赖网络。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With Full Access, Nothung checks for and automatically cleans new clipboard content only while the keyboard is visible; it stops immediately when the keyboard is dismissed or switched. Viewing and inserting saved items does not require network access."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完全访问后，Nothung 只在键盘可见期间检查并自动清理新的剪贴板；收起或切换键盘后立即停止。查看和插入已有记录不依赖网络。"
          }
        }
