    "正则规则按列表顺序执行，一条规则内也按行顺序替换。用于参数规则无法表达的域名、路径和文本整形。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Regular-expression rules run in list order, and replacements within a rule run line by line. Use them for domain, path, parameter, or text transformations that parameter rules cannot express."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正则规则按列表顺序执行，一条规则内也按行顺序替换。用于参数规则无法表达的域名、路径和文本整形。"
          }
        }
      }
