    "自定义规则、处理开关和有限的剪贴板集合仅保存在设备上的 Nothung App Group 中，用于主 App、Action Extension、键盘与快捷指令。Nothung 不会上传这些数据；导入、导出或清空只会在你明确操作时发生。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Custom rules, behavior switches, and the limited clipboard collection are stored only in the Nothung App Group on the device for use by the main app, Action Extension, keyboard, and Shortcuts. Nothung does not upload this data; importing, exporting, or clearing it occurs only when you explicitly request it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自定义规则、处理开关和有限的剪贴板集合仅保存在设备上的 Nothung App Group 中，用于主 App、Action Extension、键盘与快捷指令。Nothung 不会上传这些数据；导入、导出或清空只会在你明确操作时发生。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
