    "主 App 和分享扩展不需要输入法完全访问。Nothung 键盘的基础输入和离线清理所选链接也无需开启；只有读取系统剪贴板、访问共享记录或联网展开短链时才需要。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The main app and Share extension do not require Full Access for the keyboard. Basic typing and offline cleaning of selected links in the Nothung keyboard also work without it; Full Access is needed only to read the system clipboard, access shared history, or expand short links online."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主 App 和分享扩展不需要输入法完全访问。Nothung 键盘的基础输入和离线清理所选链接也无需开启；只有读取系统剪贴板、访问共享记录或联网展开短链时才需要。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
