    "保存时会在本机应用当前参数与正则规则，不会展开短链或发起网络请求。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When saved, the current parameter and regex rules will be applied on-device. Short links will not be expanded and no network request will be made."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存时会在本机应用当前参数与正则规则，不会展开短链或发起网络请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换到下一个键盘": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch to Next Keyboard"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换到下一个键盘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换并开始使用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch and Start Using"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换并开始使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除所有固定与未固定的本地记录": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete all pinned and unpinned local entries"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除所有固定与未固定的本地记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "前往“设置”→“通用”→“键盘”→“键盘”→“添加新键盘”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Go to Settings → General → Keyboard → Keyboards → Add New Keyboard."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前往“设置”→“通用”→“键盘”→“键盘”→“添加新键盘”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "剪贴板集合已被 20 条固定内容占满，请先取消固定或删除一条。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your clipboard collection is full with 20 pinned items. Unpin or delete one first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "剪贴板集合已被 20 条固定内容占满，请先取消固定或删除一条。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原文：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Original: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原文：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "去掉链接里的多余痕迹，把常用文本安全留在本机。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove clutter from links and keep useful text safely on this device."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "去掉链接里的多余痕迹，把常用文本安全留在本机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "参数与正则清理、最近记录都在本机完成。自动捕捉默认关闭；开启后，键盘只在可见期间读取新剪贴板。只有启用短链展开或手动展开时才会访问目标网站。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parameter and regex cleaning and recent history all stay on this device. Automatic capture is off by default; when enabled, the keyboard reads new clipboard contents only while visible. Destination sites are contacted only when short-link expansion is enabled or used manually."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参数与正则清理、最近记录都在本机完成。自动捕捉默认关闭；开启后，键盘只在可见期间读取新剪贴板。只有启用短链展开或手动展开时才会访问目标网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "参数和正则清理始终在本机完成。自动捕捉默认关闭；只有短链展开会访问目标网站。最近记录最多保存 20 条，可随时删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parameter and regex cleaning always happen on-device. Automatic capture is off by default; only short-link expansion contacts destination sites. Up to 20 recent entries are stored and can be deleted at any time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参数和正则清理始终在本机完成。自动捕捉默认关闭；只有短链展开会访问目标网站。最近记录最多保存 20 条，可随时删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "参数过滤和正则替换完全在本地进行。命中你启用的短链展开规则时，主 App 的清理流程、分享扩展，以及键盘中的手动粘贴、手动添加与已开启的自动捕捉流程会通过 HTTPS 访问当前 URL 和最多五个重定向目标；主 App 手动添加最近记录与键盘魔棒清理所选链接始终离线。其他链接只会在主 App 经你逐次确认后展开。因此相关网站会收到你的 IP 地址、完整 URL 和常规网络元数据。解析使用临时会话，不附带 Cookie、Authorization 或登录凭据，收到响应头后立即停止读取响应体。Nothung 不会自动打开最终链接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parameter filtering and regex replacement happen entirely on-device. When a link matches an enabled short-link expansion rule, cleaning in the main app or Share extension, plus manual paste, manual addition, or enabled automatic capture in the keyboard, accesses the current URL and up to five redirect destinations over HTTPS. Manually adding a recent entry in the main app and using the keyboard's magic-wand action to clean a selected link always remain offline. Other links are expanded only after individual confirmation in the main app. The relevant sites therefore receive your IP address, full URL, and standard network metadata. Resolution uses an ephemeral session, sends no cookies, Authorization header, or login credentials, and stops reading the response body as soon as headers arrive. Nothung never opens the final link automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参数过滤和正则替换完全在本地进行。命中你启用的短链展开规则时，主 App 的清理流程、分享扩展，以及键盘中的手动粘贴、手动添加与已开启的自动捕捉流程会通过 HTTPS 访问当前 URL 和最多五个重定向目标；主 App 手动添加最近记录与键盘魔棒清理所选链接始终离线。其他链接只会在主 App 经你逐次确认后展开。因此相关网站会收到你的 IP 地址、完整 URL 和常规网络元数据。解析使用临时会话，不附带 Cookie、Authorization 或登录凭据，收到响应头后立即停止读取响应体。Nothung 不会自动打开最终链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
