    "在主 App 中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the Main App"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在主 App 中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在任意输入框切换到 Nothung。即使不开放完全访问，也能基础输入，并把宿主 App 中选中的链接用魔棒按钮离线清理后替换；完全访问用于系统剪贴板与共享记录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch to Nothung in any text field. Even without Full Access, you can type normally and use the magic-wand button to clean and replace a link selected in the host app, entirely offline. Full Access is used for the system clipboard and shared history."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任意输入框切换到 Nothung。即使不开放完全访问，也能基础输入，并把宿主 App 中选中的链接用魔棒按钮离线清理后替换；完全访问用于系统剪贴板与共享记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在其他 App 分享链接或文本，选择“使用 Nothung 复制”，即可清理并复制结果。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Share a link or text from another app and choose “Copy with Nothung” to clean and copy the result."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在其他 App 分享链接或文本，选择“使用 Nothung 复制”，即可清理并复制结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在输入框中选中含链接的文本，再点左下角按钮；完全访问仅用于剪贴板与共享历史。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select text containing a link in a text field, then tap the lower-left button. Full Access is used only for the clipboard and shared history."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在输入框中选中含链接的文本，再点左下角按钮；完全访问仅用于剪贴板与共享历史。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在输入框中通过系统键盘切换按钮选择 Nothung。Face ID iPhone 会由系统在键盘下方提供切换入口。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose Nothung using the system keyboard switcher in a text field. On iPhones with Face ID, iOS provides the switcher below the keyboard."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在输入框中通过系统键盘切换按钮选择 Nothung。Face ID iPhone 会由系统在键盘下方提供切换入口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "基础输入和离线清理宿主 App 中选中的链接不需要完全访问。只有读取系统剪贴板、访问主 App 的共享记录或展开短链时，才需要打开“允许完全访问”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Basic typing and offline cleaning of links selected in the host app do not require Full Access. Enable “Allow Full Access” only to read the system clipboard, access recent entries shared by the main app, or expand short links."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "基础输入和离线清理宿主 App 中选中的链接不需要完全访问。只有读取系统剪贴板、访问主 App 的共享记录或展开短链时，才需要打开“允许完全访问”。"
          }
        }
      }
