            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帮助"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启并给予完全访问后，只在 Nothung 键盘可见时读取新的剪贴板并保存到本机；收起键盘后立即停止。若内容命中已开启的短链展开规则，可能联网。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once enabled and granted Full Access, Nothung reads new clipboard contents and saves them on-device only while its keyboard is visible; it stops immediately when the keyboard is dismissed. Content matching an enabled short-link expansion rule may access the network."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启并给予完全访问后，只在 Nothung 键盘可见时读取新的剪贴板并保存到本机；收起键盘后立即停止。若内容命中已开启的短链展开规则，可能联网。"
