    "每项都可独立开启，稍后也能在设置中修改。标记“需要联网”的短链展开会把完整 URL 发送给目标网站。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each feature can be enabled independently and changed later in Settings. Short-link expansion marked “Network Required” sends the full URL to the destination site."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每项都可独立开启，稍后也能在设置中修改。标记“需要联网”的短链展开会把完整 URL 发送给目标网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "添加 Nothung 输入法": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
