    "移除 YouTube 分享跟踪参数，保留视频、时间点与播放列表信息。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove YouTube sharing and tracking parameters while preserving video, timestamp, and playlist information."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除 YouTube 分享跟踪参数，保留视频、时间点与播放列表信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "粘贴或输入链接，查看清理前后差异；也可手动添加、固定和复用最近记录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paste or type a link to compare before and after. You can also add, pin, and reuse recent entries manually."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
