    "自动捕捉已关闭": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic Capture Is Off"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动捕捉已关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动捕捉开启后，Nothung 只在键盘可见期间检查新的剪贴板；收起或切换键盘后立即停止。查看和插入共享记录本身不需要联网，但需要完全访问共享容器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When automatic capture is enabled, Nothung checks for new clipboard contents only while the keyboard is visible and stops immediately when it is dismissed or switched. Viewing and inserting shared entries does not itself require a network connection, but does require Full Access to the shared container."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动捕捉开启后，Nothung 只在键盘可见期间检查新的剪贴板；收起或切换键盘后立即停止。查看和插入共享记录本身不需要联网，但需要完全访问共享容器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动捕捉默认关闭，Nothung 不在后台监控剪贴板。你开启自动捕捉并为输入法打开“允许完全访问”后，键盘只在屏幕上可见期间检查剪贴板变化，自动读取、清理并保存新文本；键盘收起或切换后即停止。完全访问也允许键盘在你点按粘贴按钮时读取当前剪贴板，并访问与主 App 共享的最近记录；键盘手动添加会处理你输入的内容。主 App 通过可见的系统“粘贴”控件读取你选择的内容，也会保存你手动加入最近记录的内容；分享扩展只接收宿主 App 提供的内容。Nothung 在本机保存最多 20 条原文和清理结果，可逐条删除、固定或全部清空。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic capture is off by default, and Nothung does not monitor the clipboard in the background. After you enable automatic capture and turn on “Allow Full Access” for the keyboard, it checks for clipboard changes only while visible on-screen, then automatically reads, cleans, and saves new text; it stops when the keyboard is dismissed or switched. Full Access also lets the keyboard read the current clipboard when you tap Paste and access recent entries shared with the main app. Manual addition in the keyboard processes the text you enter. The main app reads content you choose through a visible system Paste control and also saves content you manually add to recent entries; the Share extension receives only content supplied by the host app. Nothung stores up to 20 original texts and cleaned results on-device; you can delete or pin individual entries, or clear them all."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动捕捉默认关闭，Nothung 不在后台监控剪贴板。你开启自动捕捉并为输入法打开“允许完全访问”后，键盘只在屏幕上可见期间检查剪贴板变化，自动读取、清理并保存新文本；键盘收起或切换后即停止。完全访问也允许键盘在你点按粘贴按钮时读取当前剪贴板，并访问与主 App 共享的最近记录；键盘手动添加会处理你输入的内容。主 App 通过可见的系统“粘贴”控件读取你选择的内容，也会保存你手动加入最近记录的内容；分享扩展只接收宿主 App 提供的内容。Nothung 在本机保存最多 20 条原文和清理结果，可逐条删除、固定或全部清空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "要加入最近记录的内容": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
