            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入法与隐私"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "返回键盘列表，选择 Nothung。若你需要系统剪贴板、主 App 的共享记录或短链展开，再开启“允许完全访问”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Return to the keyboard list and select Nothung. Turn on “Allow Full Access” only if you need the system clipboard, recent entries shared by the main app, or short-link expansion."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返回键盘列表，选择 Nothung。若你需要系统剪贴板、主 App 的共享记录或短链展开，再开启“允许完全访问”。"
