    "通过 GitHub Issues 联系支持": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contact Support via GitHub Issues"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 GitHub Issues 联系支持"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重定向规则是联网许可列表。命中后，主 App、“使用 Nothung 复制”，以及键盘中的手动粘贴、手动添加与已开启的自动捕捉流程会跟随最多五次 HTTPS 跳转，再清理最终链接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Redirect rules are an allowlist for network access. When a link matches, the main app, “Copy with Nothung,” and manual paste, manual addition, or enabled automatic capture in the keyboard follow up to five HTTPS redirects before cleaning the final link."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重定向规则是联网许可列表。命中后，主 App、“使用 Nothung 复制”，以及键盘中的手动粘贴、手动添加与已开启的自动捕捉流程会跟随最多五次 HTTPS 跳转，再清理最终链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
